--------------------------------------------------------------------------
NOTICES — bundled data and external dependencies
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Bundled dictionary data (data/webster1913.sqlite.xz):
  Webster's Revised Unabridged Dictionary, 1913 edition. This text is in the
  PUBLIC DOMAIN. It was digitized by Project Gutenberg and refined through the
  GNU Collaborative International Dictionary of English (GCIDE). The specific
  word→definition compilation was sourced from
  https://github.com/matthewreagan/WebstersEnglishDictionary — only the
  public-domain dictionary text is redistributed here; none of that project's
  code is included. The database is regenerated by scripts/build-webster-db.sh.

Runtime dependencies (not bundled; expected to be present on Omarchy):
  - omarchy-shell / Quickshell  — the shell host this plugin runs inside
  - wl-clipboard (wl-paste)      — reads the Wayland primary selection
  - jq                           — JSON assembly in the query engine
  - sqlite3                      — offline dictionary lookups
  - xz                           — one-time decompression of the shipped DB

No network access is required or performed; every lookup is fully offline.
